# Supabase
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# Optional: EAS project id (set after `eas init`)
EXPO_PUBLIC_EAS_PROJECT_ID=

# Supabase Auth dashboard settings (not env vars — configure in project):
# - Enable Email provider
# - Confirm email: ON
# - Redirect URLs:
#     quranfamily://auth/callback
#     https://quran-quest-5640.vercel.app/callback
# Apply migrations:
#   supabase/migrations/20260716120000_feature_001_auth.sql
#   supabase/migrations/20260716210000_feature_001_auth_hardening.sql
#   supabase/migrations/20260812010000_feature_001_family_codes.sql
# Deploy Edge Functions:
#   register-device, child-set-pin, child-verify-pin,
#   resolve-family-code, child-unlock-with-code, send-family-push
# Family Circle chat/calls migration:
#   supabase/migrations/20260814010000_feature_family_comms.sql
# Design note: docs/feature-001-auth-design.md
#
# IMPORTANT: Replace EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL / ANON_KEY with real project values
# (local .env and Vercel). Placeholder your-project.supabase.co causes "Failed to fetch".
#
# Guest trial mode (local only — no env required):
# - Guests store nickname/age group/country/language + progress in AsyncStorage
# - Soft milestone prompt at half of Juz 30 (GUEST_MILESTONE_SURAHS in src/features/auth/constants.ts)
# - Hard guest limit at full Juz 30 (GUEST_LIMIT_SURAHS)
# - On register/login, local guest progress is staged under qq.migrated_progress.<userId>
